{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>First.</b> As in the first pericah. And these are the conditions, and from the beginning of ואלה המשפטים (\"and these are the ordinances\") until שש שנים (\"six years\") they are ordinances, and the high priest and the judge, who is the king, are obligated to teach them and to know them, and the obligations of the community are those mentioned after that, such as אלה (\"these\"):"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:22.691721201Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}